            "item_text": "<p>Ted Baker does not offer price matching against other retailers. However, if an item purchased from <a href=\"http://www.tedbaker.com/\"><strong>www.tedbaker.com</strong></a> has been recently reduced in price during a promotional event and is still available for purchase at the reduced price, you may request a price adjustment by contacting our customer service team.</p><p><strong>Conditions:</strong></p><p><em><strong>Timeframe</strong></em>: Price adjustments can only be made within <strong>14 days</strong> of your order date. Requests submitted after this period will not be eligible.</p><p><em><strong>Limitations</strong></em>: Only one price adjustment can be processed per order. Price adjustments are not applicable for events such as \"Spend & Save,\" free delivery offers, or outlet reductions.</p>"
